OL,3,GNEWSAArson ruled out after Grand       
OL,4,ABurstin Hotel fire                     
OL,6,FInvestigators have ruled out arson as  
OL,7,Fthe cause of a large fire at a landmark
OL,8,Fseaside hotel, Kent Police has said.   
OL,10,FTwo people arrested in connection with 
OL,11,Fa blaze at the Grand Burstin Hotel in  
OL,12,FFolkestone will face no further action 
OL,13,Fafter "no criminal cause" was found,   
OL,14,Faccording to the force.                
OL,16,FAbout 280 people from the hotel and 90 
OL,17,Fpeople from neighbouring flats had to  
OL,18,Fevacuate when flames took hold in the  
OL,19,Fearly hours of 19 September.           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
