OL,3,GNEWSAArson ruled out after Grand       
OL,4,ABurstin Hotel fire                     
OL,6,FKent Fire and Rescue Service said the  
OL,7,Ffire started in the hotel's            
OL,8,Fbelow-ground level and "has been linked
OL,9,Fto lithium-ion batteries".             
